										cell contours.</span
									>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="wbc-step-num">3</span>
									<span class="wbc-step-text"
										>Review the overall counts, cell type
										distribution, and inspect individual
										cell crops.</span
									>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<div class="wbc-guide-note">
								<strong>Note:</strong> Supported formats are JPG and
								PNG up to 20MB.
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Quick Try Sample Image -->
						<div class="wbc-sample-section">
							<h3 class="wbc-guide-title">Quick Try</h3>
							<button
								id="wbcSampleBtn"
								class="wbc-sample-btn"
								title="Click to test with raptor_wbc_00001.jpeg"
